{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act54side", "eventName": "月行水上", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "SR-8", "avgTag": "行动后", "storyName": "月满", "storyInfo": "结城理等人打败了强大的怪物，吉阿达向裘里奥敞开心扉，诉说了自己对于“仪式”真正的寄托，也承认了裘里奥的怀念与痛苦。在与结城理和吉阿达的对话中，裘里奥放下了死志，异变也终于消散……", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g8_rooftop_dark", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳，咳咳……呜……嘶……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1"}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然……咳咳……但我不喜欢……窒息这个死法……咳咳……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_darkmagic", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_tearspace", "delay": 1.0}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结城理看得很清楚，怪物尚未彻底消散，抛出裘里奥之后，它融化在了阴影中。"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "满月般的巨大异变光环依然悬在空中，裘里奥跪在地上痛苦地咳呛，摸索着……"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "埃癸斯快步上前，踢开了裘里奥手边的铳。"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#8$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "裘里奥，不要这样做。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#8$3"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阻止我……有意义吗……咳……你们没办法……一直救我的……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不会一直想要这样做的。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……为什么……会这么想？难道拉特兰……还能回到以前吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我确实应该……和父亲一起走的……但是我……胆怯了……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我竟然……不知道他当时……咳……是什么心情……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我害怕了……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#9$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以后……永远……都会这样……这里的每个人……都会这样……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#6$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "为什么……不让我……结束……？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#6$1"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结局……已经不会改变了……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#6$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#3$2"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#4$1", "focus": "m", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……如果是这样，那我是不是早就应该去死了？不止是我，所有的黎博利，所有萨科塔以外的人。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#4$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我真想对你这么说——", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#4$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……但这里的痛苦已经够多了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达蹬掉鞋子，坐在了地上，坐在跪着的裘里奥身边。"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你想靠着我吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……吉阿达，咳咳……你也要救我吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我救不了谁，我没那么了不起。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达的声音冷淡，手却轻拍着萨科塔的后背，帮他平复气息。"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "孩子们刚才把你从怪物手里抢过来，我远远看着都很害怕。我坐下来可不是为了你，是因为腿吓软了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但葬礼还没有结束，陪你休息一会儿之后，你还要和我一起回到葬礼上。你安排的那些东西，你要负责任。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算要先送走客人，送走客人之后，我们也还有工作要完成。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你是在催自杀的人回去工作吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别笑了。我说，你平时就该少笑一点。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不想看见我笑，还要救我，还要让我回到你精心筹备的葬礼上吗？明明我都把葬礼搞成这样了……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也觉得你很离谱。不过现在，我稍微明白你的意思了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我之前觉得，你只不过是抱着“传统”不肯放手，自以为是，对现实视而不见……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#13$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我不是吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#13$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你真的对现实视而不见，怎么会痛苦。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你只是想要改变它，那我们就是一样的。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你知道在我心中，仪式是什么吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "仪式是语言，是一种“传达”，把难以表述的东西“翻译”成可以看见、触摸、体会、践行的事。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要是传达，就会有缺憾。萨科塔的仪式曾经是完美的，因为你们其实不需要“翻译”，仪式只是心领神会之后的舞蹈。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以之前我讨厌你设计的葬礼，刻板地跳着过去的舞没有意义，只有可悲和可笑。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果仪式是“传达”，那么它首要的美德就是诚实。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那现在……你不觉得我在撒谎了？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为你并没有。你真心实意地……想要在葬礼上传达快乐。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是因为顽固地无视悲伤和遗憾，只是因为你很怀念过去……想留下那样的感情。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不知道……对萨科塔来说，拉特兰曾经是一种每时每刻都将你们包裹在其中的感情吗……？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也不知道……或者是忘了。也许我曾经体会过，但我好像很不适合那样生活……父亲带我离开了。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你只是想留在你想象中的、过去的拉特兰吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你这么说的话，好像确实是这样了……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊啊……好困难啊。吉阿达。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看，我以为设计仪式是我擅长的事了，可是我做得多糟糕。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#13$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你说仪式是“传达”，可我设计了这么多环节和内容，都没能“传达”给你，最后还是用铳打自己的头，你才相信我。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#13$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要是传达，就会有缺憾，刚才就告诉你了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们本来就只能尝试着去说，去摸索别人和自己的想法，试探着对话，做出不确定的判断。萨科塔之外的人，一直都是这样活着的。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算只有这么愚钝又脆弱的心，人也……并非不能感受别人、理解别人。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "理解只是需要支付代价。尝试的努力、犯错的风险、失败的悔恨、把自尊作为赌注……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "输得精光确实是一件可怕的事，有时我也想要吝啬一点……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……这我倒是发现了。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你才没资格说我，发现东西不再免费供应了就害怕到想要逃走的蠢货！", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#4$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好吧，需要骂得这么难听吗……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也许我还会失败的，我以前就做得很糟糕，以后也许会更糟糕。也许我永远都会失败，直到尽头还是失败。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#8$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别这么肯定，裘里奥。那不是放弃的理由。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#8$3"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "理啊，你很固执呢。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "和我不一样，你是真的相信你一定能做到，对吧？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也不是。我只是不想放弃。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3"}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……真是让人担心的小孩。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结城可不需要你来担心，他比你可靠多了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你休息够了吧？该和我一起回到葬礼上去了，是真的还有很多事要做。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "生活是不会结束的……这是它的优点，或者缺点，你只好接受它。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#10$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_darkmagic", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_tearspace", "delay": 1.0}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g7_rooftop", "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 4.0}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 5.0}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_sys_act16side_intro", "key": "$m_sys_act16side_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……啊，异变的景象，消散了！", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$2"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，我们消灭那个怪物了吗？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……如果一切如博士所推测，那它的本质应该是不可能完全消灭的……", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#4$2"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#7$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是，我们确实击败了那个怪物，这点我可以确定。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#7$2"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对呀，连那种诡异的景象都消失了嘛……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$2"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……啊！", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$2"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "风花姐，怎么了？！", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#9$2"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那种杂音……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$2"}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#2$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一直以来干扰着我感知的杂音，也开始减弱了！", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#2$2"}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我好像能稍微感知到大家的气息了……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#4$2"}, {"id": 175, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#2$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等杂音再减弱一些，也许……就能感知到门扉的位置了！", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#2$2"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}